{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"You have no form. And yet you feel coarse fur brush against you as the wolves circle.","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:44:49.393000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869379769706373150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"I make no attempt to hide my fear, but also project my resolve","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:45:30.560000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869379942373261342","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"It braves the unknown.\" One wolf says to the other.","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:45:39.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869379981191544833","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"It approaches he who devours Odin at the end of time, just as Odin himself once did at this very Cairn.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:47:39.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869380483564310558","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"It seeks to give up freedom. To be enslaved once again by it's own flesh.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:49:22.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869380913946046544","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"What say you spirit?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:49:41.874000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T00:49:49.672000Z","id":"869380996460589056","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"I too seek knowledge . . . and power. As he did\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:49:45.185000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869381010347917352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Freedom is choice. If I choose this slavery once more, others can be free.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:51:33.154000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869381463202746370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"The words are formed in pain and sorrow.","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:51:53.298000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869381547692810350","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"The fool thinks they are separate things. Knowledge and Power and Flesh are all one thing. Bliss and Rest and Release are all within your reach now. How came you into your current freedom that you disdain?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:54:22.880000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869382175085170748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"I . . . believe? I was cursed. That my magic . . . \" A few snaps of current and static pops can be heard \"Is all that remains of a powerful form I once held. But I cannot remember.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:59:07.317000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869383368100413502","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"This is why you seek to be meat clad. Because of your ignorance. In a lack of understanding you seek knowledge but forsake wisdom. Brighten your countenance frail whisper. You shall have a body once again.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T01:02:11.224000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T01:02:18.933000Z","id":"869384139462283334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"We are hunger. We are avarice. We are the drive to take what you need. We are the drive to take what you want.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T01:04:13.746000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869384653356814387","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"You shall bring us tribute for all of your days. An offering of meat and an offering of power. Once a week you shall present before the tree 100 pounds of raw meant. Once per week you shall present before the tree 1000 gold. Should either of these terms be broken. Freki will become as Fenris to exact the Ragnarok price and consume you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T01:08:43.957000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869385786703884288","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"You shall take on the form of a wolf for 24 hours. And no one may ever know how you have returned to the living. After the 24 hours your wolf form will split in two and you shall arise in a new body. Covered in meat and blood and tears of pain.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T01:12:02.725000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869386620397318225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\" Should you ever attempt break this geas not to speak, Great pain (5d10 psy damage) will strike you. And should you ever succeed. Freki will become as Fenris to exact the Ragnarock price and consume you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T01:14:09.483000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T01:14:15.630000Z","id":"869387152058900521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"Geri takes the soul in his mouth and rends it, remaking it to fit within a wolf.","created_at":"2021-07-27T01:15:42.364000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869387541630033971","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"I want to protect my new home. I seek to protect her people.\" I pause. \"And I want to live my life.\"\n\n\"I find your bargain suitable, Wolves of the Wanderer.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T01:15:49.583000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869387571908730900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
